<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
{{> head title="계정 생성"}}
<body>
  {{> header}}
  {{> sidebar page="admin-account"}}

  <div class="app-main">
    <div class="app-content">
      <div class="page-header">
        <div>
          <h1>계정 생성</h1>
          <p>로그인 계정을 등록합니다. 비밀번호는 bcrypt 로 암호화됩니다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <div class="card shadow-md rounded-lg">
            <div class="card-body">
              <form id="accountForm" novalidate>
                <div class="mb-3">
                  <label for="loginId" class="form-label">로그인 ID</label>
                  <input type="text" class="form-control" id="loginId" name="loginId"
                    placeholder="영문/숫자/_ 3~30자" required />
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                  <label for="password" class="form-label">비밀번호</label>
                  <input type="password" class="form-control" id="password" name="password"
                    placeholder="8자 이상" required />
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                  <label for="accountName" class="form-label">이름</label>
                  <input type="text" class="form-control" id="accountName" name="accountName" required />
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                  <label for="roleCode" class="form-label">역할</label>
                  <select class="form-select" id="roleCode" name="roleCode" data-code-group="ROLE_TYPE" required></select>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                  <label for="useYn" class="form-label">사용여부</label>
                  <select class="form-select" id="useYn" name="useYn" data-code-group="USE_YN" required></select>
                </div>

                <div id="formMessage" class="mb-3" role="alert"></div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">생성</button>
                <a href="/admin/account" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">취소</a>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {{> footer version="0.0.1"}}
  </div>

  {{> scripts}}
  <script src="/js/admin/form-util.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/admin/account/new.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
